HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The iiwwxx device driver first appeared in OpenBSD 6.7.

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The iiwwxx driver does not support any of the 802.11ax capabilities offered
     by the adapters.  Additional work is required in ieee80211(9) before
     those features can be supported.

